!Name: p00880
!C 22 Jan 2001 David Eppstein wrote: "This is pretty much the obvious
!C construction for a p880 gun: add a p5 period-doubler to a p440 gun.
!C But the new p22 technology makes this somewhat smaller than
!C Leithner's p880 (which crashed two p44 glider streams to produce a
!C p220 Herschel stream, then period-quadrupled the Herschels)."
!C 21 Apr 2004 - Scot Ellison - Welding brings in the p44 component.
!Source: guns1j-20121211
